      "writtenOn": "2023-11-27T12:13:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have feeling that this function should be not touched.\n\nThere is mechanism which monitors the LocalSink Session and it should be enough.\n\nactually this call `handleSinkMonitoringStatus(LeAudioStackEvent.STATUS_STREAMING_REQUESTED);` is a part of that mechanism. \nI guess there will be two same calls now - one from Native and one internally called here from Java.",
