      "writtenOn": "2023-11-28T09:50:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually Audio Manager does not handle receiver only devices - this needs to be fixed on Audio Framework side.\n\nTo handle Voice Calls only way is to rely on this method \"setInCall\". Once Audio Framework would be able to handle this case, this can be removed.\n\nThere should be also no \"twice\" call of handleSinkMonitoringStatus with request for streaming. Native should only notify about STREAMING REQUEST when unicast group is inactive.",
